          "name": "start_batch",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:7aa3fe1b6ff505117471f8d6852071223d479c110a476b186fa45b05bfc3a0b9",
          "description": "Start an automated sequential batch transcription of all untranscribed files in a folder. Scans for files without a matching .txt, sorts by duration (shortest first), and processes them one at a time as background jobs. Each file is validated after completion — empty or suspiciously short outputs are flagged. Batch self-advances without polling when each file finishes. Returns a batch ID to use with check_batch_progress. ⚠️ Privacy: when privacy_mode is active, one confirmation is required before the batch starts. All files then process unattended. No transcript text is returned to the API.",
